==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|frm|en}} {{m|frm|quartil}}, from {{etyl|ML.|en}} {{m|la|quartilus}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|statistics}} Any of the three [[point]]s that divide an [[ordered]] [[distribution]] into four parts, each containing a [[quarter]] of the [[population]].
# {{label|en|statistics}} Any one of the four groups so divided.
#: ''This school is ranked in the first '''quartile'''.''

